1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,720
你还在看吗
You're still on that thing?

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,960
你一直盯着电脑到底看什么呢
What are you constantly looking at on your computer?

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:05,660
你真的想要
Is that a question

4
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,320
家里的人开始问这个问题吗
you really want people asking around here?

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,480
说得对 我不想
Indeed, it is not.

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,440
我只是在看大学录取情况
I'm just checking college acceptances.

7
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,080
学校随时可能发通知
I mean, they should be posting them any day.

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,280
你不能把整个春假
You cannot spend your entire spring break

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,400
花在等录取通知上吧
worrying about college admissions.

10
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,457
你应该跟海莉一起去那个音乐节
You should go to that -- that music festival thing with Haley.

11
00:00:17,457 --> 00:00:19,720
找点乐子 学会放松
Do something fun. Learn to relax a --

12
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,297
我们所有的遥控器都得留着吗
Do we have to keep every remote we have ever owned?

13
00:00:22,297 --> 00:00:25,620
垃圾填埋场的某处刚有个光驱弹了出来
Somewhere in a landfill, a laser disc just ejected.

14
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,660
我不能带艾丽克斯去音乐节
Uh, I can't bring Alex to the festival

15
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:30,980
因为我是去工作 勘查最新流行趋势
because I am going for work to research new fashion trends.

16
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,660
我得和人们打成一片
I need to blend in, you know?

17
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,080
所有人都会以为她是条子
Everyone will think she's a cop.

18
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,440
我可以坐在这担惊受怕毁掉自己的一天
Well, I could sit here and worry and ruin my day,

19
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,860
或者跟海莉一起去毁掉她的一天
or I could go with Haley and ruin hers.

20
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,600
我去拿我的防晒霜
I'll grab my sunscreen.

21
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:41,640
早上好
Good morning.

22
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:42,700
爸
Hey, Dad.

23
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,320
我不想让你难堪 可海莉起得比你早
I hate to shame you, but Haley woke up before you.

24
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,180
海莉昨天没跑十公里
Well, Haley didn't run a 10K yesterday

25
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,620
去为秃头症患者争取关注
to raise awareness for alopecia.

26
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:49,860
秃头症是什么
What's alopecia?

27
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,580
这就是我去跑步的原因
That is why I run.

28
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,240
亲爱的 今天的春季大扫除
Honey, I could really use your help

29
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,049
真的需要你的帮助
with spring cleaning today.

30
00:00:54,049 --> 00:00:56,600
我需要把这些盒子都拿到捐赠中心去
I got to get all these boxes down to the donation center.

31
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,940
我想帮 可是我要工作
Wish I could, but I've got work.

32
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,300
然后还要和卢克一起跳蹦床
Then Luke and I have got some important trampolining to do.

33
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,358
我真喜欢这么平等的分工方式
I just love how equally we divide our responsibilities.

34
00:01:03,358 --> 00:01:05,020
鉴于你的学校活动取消了
Figured we'd do a little father/son bonding

35
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,420
我们该做点父子活动
since your school trip was canceled.

36
00:01:06,957 --> 00:01:08,663
你可以教我邓菲翻转
You can teach me the Dunphy Tuck.

37
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:12,460
我欣赏你的热情 但那太危险了
I love your enthusiasm, son, but it's way too dangerous.

38
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,180
一个动作错了 你就可能摔个嘴啃弹簧
One wrong move, and you're eating springs.

39
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,320
不 那不是
Oh, no, no, those are --

40
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,220
那是我的班卓琴吗
Is that my banjo?

41
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,980
当我遇见身边这位女士的时候
When I met this little lady sitting next to me,

42
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:22,040
我们一见钟情
it was love at first sight.

43
00:01:22,602 --> 00:01:24,700
是的 我已经弹棉花
Yep, I've been noodling around on the ol' flyswatter

44
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,940
弹了好几年了
for a couple of years now.

45
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:28,000
被伟大前辈们所激励
I was inspired by the greats

46
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,100
斯克鲁日 科米特
-- Scruggs, Kermit.

47
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:31,160
尽管这玩意练起来很难
It's hard to practice, though,

48
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:32,920
因为它会让克莱尔欲火焚身
because it gets Claire so hot and bothered.

49
00:01:37,441 --> 00:01:40,058
我觉得我听够了
- What do you -- - I think I've heard enough.

50
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,280
你真走运
Lucky for you,

51
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,438
我刚好有时间弹一曲《小短面包》
I've got time for a couple verses of "Shortnin' bread."

52
00:01:47,438 --> 00:01:48,266
不不不
No, no, no, no, no.

53
00:01:48,266 --> 00:01:50,197
不 它在盒子里 要被丢掉了
No, no, it's in the box. It's leaving the house.

54
00:01:50,197 --> 00:01:52,349
我再也忍受不了那鬼哭狼嚎了
I-I can never hear that awful thing again.

55
00:01:52,636 --> 00:01:54,380
-可你还叫我班卓琴手呢 -我知道
- But you called me "Banjovi." - I know.

56
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:56,240
只要能让它停下 我做什么都可以
I did whatever was necessary to make it stop.

57
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:58,140
等等 那是说你也不喜欢我吹风笛吗
Wait. Does that mean you also didn't like my bagpiping?

58
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,200
所以我们才有了卢克吗
Is that why we have Luke?!

59
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,000
不是这样的
It's not.

60
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,840
是这样吗
Is it?

61
00:02:15,092 --> 00:02:16,740
小卡 你不吃甜品吗
Ay, Cam, no dessert for you?

62
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:17,540
不吃
No, none for me.

63
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,980
今晚我要穿上紧身猫猫装
I have to fit into a skintight cat costume tonight

64
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:20,580
因为要去...
because I'm gonna --

65
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:22,400
你们关上房门做任何事
Whatever you do behind closed doors

66
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,340
都是你们自己的事
is your own business.

67
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:26,700
因为我要在教职员才艺秀上演唱《回忆》
Because I'm singing "Memory" at the faculty follies.

68
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,560
为了筹集资金
It's a fundraiser

69
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,080
教师们要表演节目
where the teachers do a little talent show.

70
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,800
要不我去看你演出吧
Ay, maybe I come see you.

71
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,100
我戒掉了肥皂剧
I need to find something to watch

72
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:33,980
总得找点东西看
since I had to give up my soap operas.

73
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,480
因为你一心看剧忽略了乔吗
Oh, because you've been neglecting Joe?

74
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,520
不 因为我让杰戒了雪茄
No, it's because I asked Jay to stop smoking cigars,

75
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,940
他说如果我能戒肥皂剧
and he said that he would quit

76
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:41,920
他就戒雪茄
if I stopped watching the soap operas.

77
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,380
可那太难了
But it's very hard.

78
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:44,480
有什么难的
What's so damn hard?

79
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,780
每周播的都是一样的
It's the same thing every week --

80
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,760
健忘症 邪恶的双胞胎
Amnesia, evil twins,

81
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:49,720
最后两个女人在喷泉里打架
two ladies end up fighting in a fountain.

82
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:52,100
有什么好看的 是为了逃脱现实吗
I mean, what is it? Is it some sort of an escape?

83
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:55,160
至少比朝宝宝脸上吐烟好
It's better than blowing smoke in our baby's face.

84
00:02:56,060 --> 00:02:57,237
说到这个 他去哪儿了
Where did he go, anyways?

85
00:02:57,237 --> 00:02:59,500
莉莉的女童军营发来了邮件
Oh, there's an e-mail from Lily's scout camp.

86
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,120
-希望一切都好 -她很好
- I hope everything's okay. - She's fine.

87
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,220
米奇尔很担心 因为他不喜欢露营
Mitchell's nervous because he's not a camper.

88
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,180
他觉得住的酒店没有电视剧频道
His idea of roughing it is a hotel stay

89
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:06,440
就算条件艰苦了
where the cable doesn't get Bravo.

90
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,620
登记入住时酒店应该告诉客人的
They should tell you that when you check in.

91
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,700
好吧 收到一张照片 看
Oh, boy. Okay, here's a photo, look.

92
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,880
她在打手势
She's using the signal.

93
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:12,660
什么手势
What signal?

94
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,300
孩子们不能打电话给家长
The kids aren't allowed to call their parents,

95
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:15,700
但是营地会发照片给我们
but the camp sends out photos,

96
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:17,180
所以我们约好
so we have a code.

97
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:17,720
是的 "我们"
Yeah, "We."

98
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:19,560
竖一根手指表示很好
One finger, she's fine.

99
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:20,940
两根手指表示不高兴
Two fingers, she's unhappy.

100
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:22,099
你看 两根手指
Look at this -- two fingers.

101
00:03:22,099 --> 00:03:23,420
我不在手机上看照片
I don't look at pictures on a phone.

102
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:25,840
要是拍得好 就洗出来放进相册
If it's a good shot, get a print, put it in an album.

103
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:27,360
这种时候说这个真合适
Interesting time to take a stand.

104
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:28,960
可看起来她只是
But she looks like she's just doing

105
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,980
在朋友身后比"兔耳朵"
the bunny ears behind her girlfriend.

106
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,500
她就是那样做
Which is exactly what she would do

107
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,280
好骗过大人们 传达秘密信号
to get a secret signal past the authorities.

108
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:36,200
那是女童军营 不是莱文沃思
Okay, it's a scout camp, not Leavenworth.

109
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,239
她在笑呢 你担心什么啊
She's smiling. What are you worried about?

110
00:03:38,239 --> 00:03:41,293
因为这是她第一次离开家
Because it's her first time away from home. It --

111
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,420
知道吗 也许是这样
You know what? That's probably it.

112
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,219
是我太紧张了 所以...
I'm just -- I'm stressing out, so --

113
00:03:45,219 --> 00:03:46,725
我要去趟办公室
You know, I'm -- I'm gonna go to the office

114
00:03:46,725 --> 00:03:48,200
拿点文件
and pick up some papwork.

115
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,820
我跟你一起走好了
You know what? I'm gonna tag along with you.

116
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:51,180
你可以把我送到俱乐部
You can drop me off at the club.

117
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,660
我其实不是去办公室
I'm not really going to the office.

118
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:53,780
随便 我得抽根雪茄
Don't care. Need a cigar.

119
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,630
根据我刚刚的勘查情况
Based off the walk I just took,

120
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:00,407
侧乳是最新的股沟
side-boob is the new butt crack.

121
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,060
你想去前面吗
So, you want to head down front?

122
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,080
艾丽克斯
Alex!

123
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,700
你得喝了这个
Okay, you need to drink this.

124
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,496
我再去拿一杯
I'll get a new one.

125
00:04:07,496 --> 00:04:08,820
这里有伏特加吗
Uh, is there vodka in here?

126
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:11,120
如果有的话 它没在发挥什么作用
If there is, it's not doing anybody any good

127
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,060
除非我把它弄到你嘴里
until I get it in there.

128
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,020
米开朗基罗说过如何用大理石
Michelangelo talked about chiseling

129
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:17,680
凿出美丽的雕像
beautiful sculptures out of marble.

130
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:20,760
我的凿子是长岛冰茶
Well, my chisel is a long island iced tea,

131
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:24,180
我用它雕刻出书呆女的狂野一面
and I use it to free the party girl from the block of nerd.

132
00:04:24,940 --> 00:04:25,560
音乐
Music!!

133
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:27,740
好棒
Yeah!

134
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:31,800
并非我的所有雕塑都是杰作
Not all my sculptures are masterpieces.

135
00:04:34,556 --> 00:04:35,468
我回来了
I'm ho--

136
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:45,940
好棒啊
Oh, amazing!

137
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,080
亲爱的 你听见了吗 他很棒有没有
Honey, were you listening? Isn't he good?

138
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,660
-真的很棒 -是啊
- Really good. - Yeah.

139
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:51,380
真的很棒
Really good.

140
00:04:51,467 --> 00:04:53,900
我还以为你不喜欢班卓琴呢
I -- I thought you didn't like the banjo.

141
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:54,840
我也以为我不喜欢
I didn't think I did, either,

142
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,460
但他弹得很好
but there's just something about the way he plays.

143
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:59,103
太悦耳了
It's so... it's so musical.

144
00:05:00,015 --> 00:05:01,491
这是怎么 给老爸的一个惊喜吗
So, what's this, a surprise for old dad?

145
00:05:01,491 --> 00:05:03,940
你偷偷上了几个月的课了吗 也许更久
You been secretly taking lessons for months, probably longer?

146
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:05,920
没有 我今天才开始摆弄
Nope. I just started messing around with it today.

147
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:07,160
你学了一整首歌曲
And you learned a whole song.

148
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,920
实际上他学了两首 给他演奏另一首
Actually, he learned two! Play him the other one.

149
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:10,920
算了 不用了
I'm good, thanks.

150
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,560
那是我的鞋子吗
Are those my shoes?

151
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,300
我在捐赠盒里找到的
I found them in the box of donations.

152
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,900
刚好合脚
They fit him perfectly.

153
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:18,200
就是有点点紧
If anything, they're a little snug.

154
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,939
他可以踢掉鞋子了
Well, he can kick them off,

155
00:05:19,939 --> 00:05:21,880
因为我们要去跳蹦床了
'cause we are about to do some trampolining.

156
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,000
该去学邓菲翻转了
Time to learn the Dunphy Tuck.

157
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,920
你不是说他可能会受伤吗
I thought you said he could get hurt doing that.

158
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,480
不可能一直保证安全
It's impossible to be safe all the time.

159
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:28,000
你走进家里都可能受伤呢
You can get hurt just walking into your own house.

160
00:05:29,403 --> 00:05:31,160
我要去把我的戏服挂在
Okay, I'm gonna go hang my costume up

161
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,860
更衣室里 开始暖嗓子了
in my dressing room and start warming up my voice.

162
00:05:32,997 --> 00:05:34,882
更衣室 带我去看看
Dressing room? Ay, show me.

163
00:05:34,882 --> 00:05:36,852
不行 就是男卫生间里的残疾人座位
I can't. It's the handicapped stall in the men's room.

164
00:05:36,852 --> 00:05:38,800
但今晚的重点不是卡梅隆·塔克
But tonight is not about Cameron Tucker.

165
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,480
而是孩子们
It's about the kids.

166
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:41,900
塔克教练
Coach tucker.

167
00:05:41,983 --> 00:05:43,349
卡普兰先生
Senor Kaplan.

168
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,280
那是什么 穴居人戏服吗
What is that, a caveman costume?

169
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,020
不是 我刚报名演唱
No, I just signed up

170
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,240
《猫》里的《回忆》
to sing "Memory" from "Cats."

171
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:49,520
不过希望我不是在
Although I hope I'm not on

172
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,560
《油脂》合唱团之后上台
after the "Grease" Chorus.

173
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,300
很难跟他们媲美
They're a tough act to follow.

174
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:52,980
《回忆》吗
"Memory"?

175
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,140
但那是你要唱的歌
But that is your song.

176
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:56,462
《回忆》吗 但那是他的歌
"Memory"? But that was his song.

177
00:05:56,462 --> 00:05:57,080
两件猫的戏服
Two cat costumes?

178
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,620
我们不能唱同一首歌
Well, we can't both sing the same song.

179
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,380
那是对才艺秀不尊重
I mean, that would make a mockery of the follies.

180
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,360
我去年演唱过了
Oh, well, I sang last year.

181
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,960
拜托 我坚持 你唱吧
Please, I insist -- you sing.

182
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,060
他放弃了自己的歌
He gave up his song.

183
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,520
去年他就唱的这首歌
That was his song last year.

184
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,780
命运会眷顾他的
Fate will smile upon him.

185
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:08,560
你愿意为我这样做吗
You would do that for me?

186
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:10,960
这真是我见过的
This is literally the nicest gesture

187
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,900
最大度的行为
I have ever witnessed --

188
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,120
而我可是从加拿大来的
And I'm from Canada.

189
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:15,760
我不喜欢这样
I don't like this.

190
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:18,140
这就像是罗萨尔芭和玛莉索
This is just like when Rosalba and Marisol

191
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:20,200
发现她们嫁给了同一个男人
found out that they were married to the same man.

192
00:06:20,246 --> 00:06:22,640
玛莉索让步了
Marisol backed down,

193
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,740
结果两天后她死了
but she was found dead two days later.

194
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,720
歌洛莉亚 我觉得你可能
Okay, Gloria, I think there's a chance

195
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,320
是在把一件很正常的事
you're trying to turn a very normal situation

196
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,460
变成了你的肥皂剧
into one of your soap operas.

197
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,939
好吧 但是想想看
Okay, but imagine --

198
00:06:31,939 --> 00:06:34,660
观众对你起立欢呼会让他崩溃的
A standing ovation for you will crush him!

199
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,018
知道吗
You know what?

200
00:06:35,018 --> 00:06:36,300
如果我顾全大局
I'll only look better

201
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,780
会让我的形象更加伟大
if I take the high road --

202
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:41,000
在后台帮帮忙 让他享受他的时刻
You know, help out backstage, let him have his moment.

203
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,360
天啊
Oh, my goodness!

204
00:06:49,812 --> 00:06:51,859
你即将看到的动作是我的曾曾曾祖父
The move you're about to see was first developed

205
00:06:51,859 --> 00:06:54,860
拉兹万·邓菲发明的
by my great-great-great- grandfather Razvan Dunphy,

206
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:55,540
但说真的
but, really,

207
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:57,680
这和人类对飞行的探索一样历史悠久
it's as old as man's quest to fly.

208
00:06:57,680 --> 00:07:00,042
只是转体空翻 对吧
It's just a flip with a twist, right?

209
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,780
还有更多的动作
There's a lot more going on,

210
00:07:01,780 --> 00:07:03,380
但你第一次看见
but you won't be able to absorb it

211
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,360
是无法全部吸收的
the first time you see it.

212
00:07:05,365 --> 00:07:08,380
一 二 三
Eins...zwei...drei--

213
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:09,160
不行了 不行了
No good. Okay.

214
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:11,920
你是对的 我没能吸收
You were right. I totally missed it.

215
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,739
我很高兴刚才没弄成 真的
I'm glad that happened. I'm actually glad that happened.

216
00:07:13,739 --> 00:07:16,388
提醒了我邓菲翻转要充满敬意才能完成
It's a good reminder, the Dunphy Tuck demands respect.

217
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:19,000
这次 我是 来
This...time...for...

218
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:20,260
真的
real!

219
00:07:22,222 --> 00:07:24,040
吉姆·麦凯 好疼[运动节目主持人]
Jim McKay, that hurts!

220
00:07:24,670 --> 00:07:27,397
我要调整一下这些弹簧
I'm gonna... just adjust these springs.

221
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,880
我觉得挺好啊
They feel fine to me.

222
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,040
你当然觉得好了
I'm sure they do.

223
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:32,180
你还没有培养出足够敏锐的脚感
You don't have the foot sensitivity of a tramp champ.

224
00:07:32,780 --> 00:07:35,340
如果让我读盲文 我...
If I ever had to read braille, I'd--

225
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:37,420
天呐 我觉得我做到了
Oh, my God! I think I did it!

226
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,180
我成功了吗
Did I do it?

227
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:39,480
差不多吧
Almost. Yeah.

228
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,980
你的姿势差了那么点
Your, your form was a little off.

229
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:43,600
真的吗 但我觉得很棒 再来一次
Really? It felt perfect. I'll try one more time.

230
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:45,400
我觉得还是不了吧
I'm not sure that's such a good idea.

231
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,020
你可能会沾上 坏习惯
You might cement in some bad...habits.

232
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:49,700
我又成功了
I did it again!

233
00:07:49,820 --> 00:07:51,260
我去给你倒杯水
I'm gonna get you some water.

234
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,467
你看起来有点不清醒
You seem lightheaded and delusional.

235
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:54,660
又一次
Again!

236
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:59,860
亲爱的 你看起来很累
Oh, honey. You look exhausted.

237
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,080
不累 我还是一如既往的威猛
Well, I am not. I am as strong as ever.

238
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,920
我是家里最威猛的人
Certainly the strongest person in the house.

239
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:06,980
卢克是在做邓菲翻转吗
Is Luke doing the Dunphy Tuck?

240
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,540
学了个百分之六七十吧
Sort of a poor man's version of it.

241
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:10,160
他加了一个全新的动作
He added a whole new twist.

242
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:12,720
他这是转多了 好好看看
It's called over-rotation. Look into it.

243
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,260
我当时忙着做扫除
I was so caught up in my spring cleaning,

244
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:18,080
过了好一阵才发现原来菲尔觉得不自信了
it took me a while to see that Phil was feeling inadequate.

245
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,840
我知道我需要做什么
I knew what I needed to do.

246
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:22,980
等你们弄完了
When you guys are done out there,

247
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:25,620
你能把这张清单拿给卢克吗
do you think you could give Luke my list?

248
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:27,700
这上面有些体力活要干
I have some chores on here that require some muscle.

249
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:28,940
也许该让我来
Maybe I should take care of that.

250
00:08:29,934 --> 00:08:31,700
我能处理好
No, no, I-I-I can handle it.

251
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:33,420
卢克正忙着不用脚尖起跳呢
Luke's pretty busy out there not pointing his toes.

252
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:35,780
他对我说"去找点事做吧"[找一条命]
So he's all like, "Get a life,"

253
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:37,320
我回他"不了谢谢 我有九条命呢"
and I'm like, "No, thanks. Got nine."

254
00:08:38,455 --> 00:08:39,482
因为我是
I mean, cause...

255
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:42,560
抱歉打扰了 我画完休息一下
Sorry to interrupt, but I just took a break from painting.

256
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,340
想着过来给你送点喝的
Wanted to come over, bring you some tea

257
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,000
顺便祝你表演成功[摔断一只爪子]
and tell you to break a paw.

258
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:48,340
他差点就被砸破头了
He almost broke his head.

259
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,357
我知道 非常抱歉
Yes, I know, and I feel horrible about that.

260
00:08:50,357 --> 00:08:51,320
我希望你明白
I-I hope you know

261
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,920
我绝不是有意伤害...
I would never intentionally do anything to harm--

262
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,240
我的喉咙
My throat!

263
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:55,860
好痛啊
It burns!

264
00:08:56,020 --> 00:08:57,180
他把茶弄得太烫了
He made the tea too hot!

265
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,000
我不是故意的
Not on purpose!

266
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:01,980
他被塔克教练的喷漆罐绊倒了
He tripped on one of Coach Tucker's paint cans.

267
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:03,520
我都不记得有把罐子放在那
I don't remember leaving that there!

268
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:06,660
看看我 我这样可上不了台
Oh, look at me. I can't command a stage.

269
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:09,180
你来接替我
You, you have to take my place.

270
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,140
我们可以把你推上台
We'll wheel you out onto stage.

271
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,629
这可不行 我们都知道
Oh, come on, we both know

272
00:09:12,629 --> 00:09:14,820
这首歌需要很多拟猫的动作
this song requires catlike movements.

273
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,660
快来人给他换装 画脸
Someone get this man into fur and makeup!

274
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:20,940
-你在干什么 -清单上最后一项
- What are you doing?! - Last item on the list--

275
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:23,240
-移桌子 -不 你不应该一个人弄
- move the table. - No. You should not be doing that alone.

276
00:09:23,300 --> 00:09:24,860
真的吗 我已经独自把冰箱搬到路边了
Really? Cause I got the fridge out to the curb.

277
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,000
-怎么做到的 -给它下药
- How? - Drug it.

278
00:09:26,060 --> 00:09:27,180
退后 我要背她起来了
Stand back. I'm turtling her.

279
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:28,219
不行 你会受伤的 亲爱的
No, you're gonna get hurt, sweetie.

280
00:09:28,219 --> 00:09:29,600
-我去找卢克来 卢克 -不用
- Let me get Luke. Luke! - No, no, no!

281
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,320
我不需要他的帮忙
I don't need his help!

282
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,660
让他去弹那宝贵的班卓琴吧
Let him play his precious Banjo!

283
00:09:34,626 --> 00:09:36,680
感觉连班卓琴都在嘲笑我
It was like the Banjo was mocking me.

284
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:39,360
*你不似从前英勇*
*You are not the man you used to be*

285
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:41,671
*每晚起夜四次*
*You get up four times at night to pee*

286
00:09:41,671 --> 00:09:42,751
*噜啦啦噜啦啦噜啦噜啦噜*
*Ba-da-dum ba bat da doot doot doo*

287
00:09:42,751 --> 00:09:44,451
*你已垂垂老去*
*You're super-duper old now*

288
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,220
休息一下吧[爵士名曲]
Take Five.

289
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:48,320
我不会弹那首歌
I don't know that one.

290
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,940
给我几分钟 我能学会
Give me a couple minutes. I'll figure it out.

291
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:52,240
这么多噪音 我很难集中精力干活
It's a little hard to get things done with all the noise.

292
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:53,500
那是什么
What's that?

293
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,240
没什么
Nothing.

294
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:56,220
那是件
Is that...

295
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:58,180
胸罩吗
a bra?

296
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,180
你不该带女生来家里的
You're not supposed to have girls up here.

297
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,060
我能解释
I can explain.

298
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,040
不必解释
You don't have to!

299
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,800
你以为自己是个成年人 但你不是
You think you're an adult, but you're not.

300
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,960
你只是住在我屋檐下的小屁孩
You're a kid living under my roof,

301
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,720
你要遵从我的规定
and you have to obey my rules!

302
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:11,280
G弦断了[丁字裤断了]
The "G" string snapped!

303
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,340
估计不是第一次在这里发生了
Probably not the first time that's happened in here.

304
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,140
不 它打到我眼睛了
No! It hit my eye!

305
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,240
我眼睛流血了吗
Is it bleeding?

306
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,120
首先 眼睛是不会流血的 所以
First of all, eyes can't bleed, so--

307
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:20,160
小萨米·戴维斯 真是够糟的[艺人 曾出车祸]
Sammy Davis Jr., that's bad!

308
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:21,740
艾丽克斯
Alex!

309
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,320
我在找我妹妹
I'm looking for my sister.

310
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:25,800
她留着棕头发
She has brown hair,

311
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,860
打扮得像个书呆子 但不是为了讽刺
dressed like a nerd, but not ironically.

312
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,180
等一下
Hang on!

313
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:31,994
喂
Hello?

314
00:10:31,994 --> 00:10:33,900
海莉 你和艾丽克斯在一起吗
Haley, are you with Alex?

315
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:35,380
她不接电话
She's not answering her phone.

316
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:37,020
这个嘛
Uh, yeah, yeah.

317
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:39,500
我们现在不在一块儿
We're just a tiny bit separated right now,

318
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:41,820
但她举止有点怪
but, uh, she's been acting a little strange.

319
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,157
天呐 你什么意思
Oh, no. What do you mean?

320
00:10:43,157 --> 00:10:46,607
她就是有点...
Um, I -- well, I-I'd say she's been, um...

321
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,740
有点不爱搭理人
a bit distant.

322
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,200
不是吧
Oh, no.

323
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,200
妈 别慌
Mom, don't freak out.

324
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,840
没 你们今早出门的时候
No, I was worried about this

325
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,200
我就有点担心了
when you two left this morning.

326
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:57,040
好吧 她就是有点放不开
Oh, okay, so she was being a little uptight.

327
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,700
开机啊 你个蠢东西[快告诉我]
Come on! Open up, you stupid thing!

328
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:02,860
好吧 她很扫兴
Okay, fine! She was a total buzzkill, okay!

329
00:11:02,860 --> 00:11:04,320
我就想让她放松点
I just wanted to relax her.

330
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:05,100
该死
Damn it.

331
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:08,020
我知道我做错了
I know, I know -- it was a mistake.

332
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:09,880
但我又没逼她喝
But it's not like I poured it down her throat!

333
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:11,240
哈佛没录取她
She didn't get into Harvard.

334
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,060
谢天谢地
Oh, thank god!

335
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:14,980
所以她才那么不正常
That's why she's been acting so weird.

336
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:16,140
等等 你说
Wait. What do you mean,

337
00:11:16,140 --> 00:11:17,220
你没逼她喝是什么意思
you didn't pour it down her throat?

338
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,060
你把她灌醉了吗
Did you get her drunk?

339
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:19,960
你黑了她的电脑
Hey, you hacked her computer!

340
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,880
那是她吗
Is that her?

341
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,080
我找到她了
Uh, I just found her.

342
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:26,360
我让她打给你
I'll have her call you.

343
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:30,560
把我运到我妹妹那儿
Take me to my sister!

344
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:36,740
莉莉的营地就在树丛后面
All right, Lily's camp is just through those trees.

345
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:38,280
-我一会就回来 -别着急
- I'll be back soon. - Take your time.

346
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:40,560
我带着雪茄呢 不寂寞
I got a couple of Robustos to keep me company.

347
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,640
那身衣裳是怎么回事
Um, what's up with the outfit?

348
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,040
身上不会沾味道
It's to keep the smoke off me

349
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,080
歌洛莉亚就不会发现了
so Gloria won't smell it.

350
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,740
你疯了吧
That's insane.

351
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:46,900
是啊 我失心疯
Yep, I've lost my mind.

352
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:49,239
祝你顺利把女儿劫出营地
Have fun breaking your daughter out of sleepaway camp.

353
00:11:49,239 --> 00:11:50,820
你当然不会理解
Oh, of course you wouldn't understand.

354
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:51,120
为什么
Why?

355
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:53,520
你忘啦
You forgot?

356
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:55,480
我忘了我不该问为什么
I forgot I shouldn't ask "Why" to things.

357
00:11:55,558 --> 00:11:57,735
当时我九岁 在营地
I was 9 years old, at camp.

358
00:11:57,735 --> 00:12:00,233
那里到处都是蚊子 厕所是露天的
There were mosquitos, compost toilets,

359
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:01,000
还有恶霸
mean kids.

360
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,201
那是个歌剧露营吧
It was theater camp, wasn't it?

361
00:12:02,201 --> 00:12:03,460
你当然记得那个了
Naturally, you remember that part.

362
00:12:03,460 --> 00:12:05,218
关键是 我恨死露营了
The point is, I hated it.

363
00:12:05,218 --> 00:12:07,280
我又冷又怕
I was -- I was cold, and I was scared,

364
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:07,760
特别是
especially

365
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:11,061
有个小孩讲了个特恐怖的鬼故事
after this kid told this terrifying ghost story,

366
00:12:11,061 --> 00:12:12,640
于是我跑出来找到一个公共电话
so I snuck away to a pay phone,

367
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,980
哭着打给你
I called you, crying,

368
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:17,400
而你的表现比托德·詹森
and in a performance even more predictable

369
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,240
在《狡猾郎中》里的表演更容易被猜透
than Todd Jansen's Artful Dodger,

370
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,920
你不接我回家
you refused to pick me up.

371
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:22,880
那是为了你好
For your own good.

372
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,440
学会保护自己
Learning to fend for yourself

373
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,480
是成为一个男人的重要一步
is an important part of becoming a man.

374
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:29,080
在你说我所有的职业成功
Before you claim that all my professional success

375
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:31,500
都得益于你当年狠心地决定
stems from your very, very brave decision

376
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,780
留在家里沙发上
to stay at home on the couch

377
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,160
看《无敌女金刚》之前
watching "The Bionic Woman,"

378
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:35,660
我要去接莉莉了
I am going to go get Lily.

379
00:12:35,660 --> 00:12:38,140
这样她才知道她可以一直依靠我
So that she knows she can always count on me.

380
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:41,680
就这样吧
It's fine.

381
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:44,560
如果你觉得戏剧性退场是这样
If that's your idea of a dramatic exit,

382
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:47,400
怪不得托德·詹森拿到了那个角色
it's no wonder Todd Jansen got that part.

383
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,080
一会儿医生就帮你看了
So, the doctor will see you in a few minutes.

384
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,280
还好有人能看得见
Nice someone can see.

385
00:12:54,546 --> 00:12:56,447
你没事的那只眼睛还能瞪人 不错
Glad to know your good eye can still roll.

386
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:58,920
你还在生气啊
So, still angry, huh?

387
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:00,820
天呐 我怎么会生气呢
Gee, why would I be angry?

388
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,940
你不过是侮辱了我 把我搞残废
Because you insulted me, maimed me, and belittled

389
00:13:02,940 --> 00:13:05,480
贬低了我在班卓琴和跳床上取得的成就
my achievements in the banjonic and trampolinic arts?

390
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,320
我知道 抱歉
I know. I'm sorry.

391
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,060
我今天的行为很不光彩
I'm not proud of my behavior today.

392
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:11,740
可能是因为昨天跑了五公里吧
Probably started with the 5K I ran yesterday.

393
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:12,580
十公里
10K.

394
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:13,940
其他人跑了十公里
For everyone else.

395
00:13:14,579 --> 00:13:17,899
这是15年来第一次我没跑完
It was the first time in 15 years I couldn't finish.

396
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:20,560
今天 我能做的事 你做得都比我好
Then, today, it's everything I can do, you can do better.

397
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:21,300
我不能
No, I can't.

398
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:22,140
你当然能
Yes, you can.

399
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:24,460
没关系 又不是你的错
It's okay. It's not your fault.

400
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,880
每个老爸都会经历这一天
Every dad goes through it --

401
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:31,060
看着儿子蜕变成男子汉的一天
The day he starts seeing his son as a man and not a boy.

402
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,240
这很令人震惊
It's a shock.

403
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:35,940
就像刚买了高清电视那会儿
Like when we first got high-def TV

404
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:37,740
发现电视上埃德·布拉德利戴着耳环
and I realized Ed Bradley had an earring.

405
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,660
我没有你想得那么威武雄壮
I'm not as much of a man as you think, dad.

406
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,440
真的吗
Oh, really?

407
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:42,800
那为什么一个小时前
How come an hour ago,

408
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:45,400
我手里有个16岁女孩的胸罩
I had a 16-year-old girl's bra in my hand?

409
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:48,940
能去个私密点的地方谈吗
Can we talk somewhere more private?

410
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,220
那胸罩是我的
The bra belongs to me.

411
00:13:53,307 --> 00:13:55,892
好吧
Oh...kay.

412
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,400
我没想到要跟你谈这个
That's not the conversation I thought we'd be having,

413
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:02,400
但如果你需要这种外在的东西
but...if that's what you need on the outside

414
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,800
来找到内心真正的自我
to feel like the luke you are on the inside --

415
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,220
不是这样
No!

416
00:14:05,460 --> 00:14:06,820
那是训练道具
It's to practice on.

417
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,420
我不会解胸罩
I stink at unhooking them.

418
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,100
上周 我试过在派对上
Last week, I tried to

419
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:12,439
解开一个女孩的胸罩
take one off a girl at a party.

420
00:14:12,439 --> 00:14:15,977
我半天都没解开 她就开始笑我
I fumbled for so long, she started to laugh.

421
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,560
到现在我都无法释怀
It still haunts me.

422
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,220
所以这周我才没出去
That's why I didn't go away this week.

423
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,980
我的活动没被取消
My trip wasn't canceled.

424
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:27,937
后来大家都知道了...
Everyone found out and...

425
00:14:27,937 --> 00:14:29,660
我懂了 你没法面对他们
I get it -- you couldn't face them.

426
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:31,080
听我说 我知道你人生的这部分
Listen, I know this part of your life

427
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,820
可能前进得比你期望的要慢
may not be moving fast enough for you,

428
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,480
但趁年轻时好好享受吧
but enjoy it while it lasts.

429
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:37,099
有一天 岁月会快得让你措手不及
Someday, your life's gonna be moving faster than you want,

430
00:14:37,099 --> 00:14:38,540
然后你可能很紧张 结果做了蠢事
and you could wind up doing something dumb,

431
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:39,660
比如弄瞎你儿子的眼睛
like blinding your son.

432
00:14:39,860 --> 00:14:40,480
我瞎了吗
I'm blind?!

433
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,239
可能不会
Probably not.

434
00:14:41,239 --> 00:14:42,385
卢克·邓菲
Luke Dunphy?

435
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:49,260
我知道我的年龄不太适合来这里了
I know I'm getting a little old for this place, but...

436
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:50,780
不过我还是喜欢来这
I do like coming here.

437
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,220
小卢克
Oh, Lukey!

438
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:54,480
你伤到眼睛了
You hurt your eye.

439
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,040
要抱抱吗
Do you need a hug?

440
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,360
抱紧点
A big one.

441
00:14:57,540 --> 00:14:58,700
来吧
Come here.

442
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:02,660
艾丽克斯 停下
Alex! Alex, stop!

443
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:04,560
我追了你快一个小时了
I have been chasing you for, like, an hour!

444
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,800
你要去哪里
Where are you going?!

445
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:08,000
这个叫伟泽的人说
This guy Weasel said he knows

446
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,060
他知道山里有处温泉
of some hot springs in the hills.

447
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,300
我们正打算去找
We were just gonna go try and find them.

448
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:13,080
好吧 那我们就十年后见
Oh, okay. So, we'll see you in, like, what, 10 years,

449
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:13,940
等你用勺子挖条地道
when you spoon-tunnel

450
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:14,840
从伟泽的地窖里逃出来的时候
your way out of Weasel's basement?

451
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,820
我知道哈佛大学的事了
I know about Harvard.

452
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:21,520
怎么知道的
How?

453
00:15:21,558 --> 00:15:23,220
妈妈在你电脑上看到的
Mom saw on your computer.

454
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:24,800
她当然会告诉你了
And of course she told you,

455
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:27,100
因为她根本不把隐私当回事
because privacy doesn't mean anything.

456
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,079
为什么还要做正确的事呢
Why do things the right way?

457
00:15:29,079 --> 00:15:31,749
-艾丽克斯 我 -不 为了什么
- Alex, I r-- - No! What's the point?

458
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:33,560
十年成绩全优
Get straight A's for 10 years,

459
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:35,520
暑假去盖房子
spend your summers building houses,

460
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,980
每天拖着大提琴去上学
drag your cello to school every day,

461
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,580
写完美的论文 都为了什么
write the perfect essay, and for what?!

462
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:43,020
"不 谢谢 艾丽克斯"
"No, thank you, Alex!"

463
00:15:43,020 --> 00:15:45,240
"我们不想录取你 艾丽克斯"
"We don't want you, Alex!"

464
00:15:45,940 --> 00:15:48,420
好了 注意你的人比注意那个
Okay, you are drawing more attention to yourself

465
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,200
拿雪貂当围巾的人还多
than the guy wearing a ferret as a scarf.

466
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,840
我不在乎了
I don't care anymore!

467
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:54,780
从小到大我都试图做到完美
I've spent my entire life trying to be perfect,

468
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:56,100
结果得到什么了
and where did it get me?

469
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:59,200
我和六千个傻子在这片空地上
I am in a field with 6,000 idiots!

470
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:04,040
知道吗 我认为这对你来说是件好事
Know what? I think that this is a good thing for you.

471
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:06,160
-今天能不能别烦我 -不能
- Can you just spare me today? - No.

472
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,760
你一定会考上其中一所
You're obviously going to get into

473
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,000
傲慢自大的学校的
one of those snooty schools,

474
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,900
偶尔你可能会考第二名
and sometimes you're gonna come in second...

475
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,920
或第四名 甚至第十名
or fourth, or maybe even tenth.

476
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,720
但你会振作精神
But you're gonna dust yourself off,

477
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:20,400
也许涂点唇膏 继续向前走
maybe put on some lipstick for once, and keep going.

478
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,980
我可以为此而难过 好吗
I'm allowed to feel bad about this, okay?

479
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:26,200
你就是个超级明星
Look, you are a superstar!

480
00:16:26,740 --> 00:16:28,120
从你十岁大我就一直说
I've been saying since you were 10

481
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,580
你以后会站在最高法院里
you're gonna be on the Supreme Court.

482
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,000
谢谢
Thanks.

483
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:33,360
不过声明一下 我会成为一名科学家
But for the record, I'm gonna be a scientist.

484
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:35,900
实验服还是法官袍
Lab coat, robe --

485
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:38,040
只要能盖住你的衣服就行
as long as something's covering up your outfit,

486
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,380
你会没事的
you're gonna be just fine.

487
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:45,840
我 不想谈这个
I...don't want to talk about it.

488
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:48,119
我曾在三场业余演出 两场同志婚礼
I had killed with that song at three amateur productions,

489
00:16:48,119 --> 00:16:51,620
和被延误的航班上完美地表演过那首歌
two gay weddings, and a two-hour gate hold on a 747,

490
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:53,660
但我能看出今天的观众们觉得
but I could tell the audience thought

491
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:56,500
我为了上台 对卡普兰先生使坏
that I had sabotaged Kaplan to grab the spotlight,

492
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,720
而我的自信卡在喉咙里
and my confidence caught in my throat

493
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,780
就像玩了三天的毛球
like a three-day furball.

494
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,621
我的表演臭到家了
I couldn't have stunk up the place worse

495
00:17:01,621 --> 00:17:03,783
臭过在猫砂盆里唱
if I'd performed in a litter box.

496
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:07,920
谢谢 谢谢你们
Thank you. Thank you very much.

497
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:12,240
太棒了 卡梅隆
Bravo, Cameron.

498
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:13,840
不说了 我回我的单间去了
Can't talk! I'll be in my stall!

499
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:19,720
现在大家都会讨厌卡梅隆了
So, now everybody hates Cameron.

500
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:22,320
好吧 我唱不了《回忆》
Okay, look, I can't sing "Memory."

501
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,700
对我来说太难了
It's too much song for me.

502
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,440
所以当我发现塔克教练
So when I found out that coach Tucker

503
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,460
想唱那首歌 我找到了借口
wanted to sing it, as well, I had my out --

504
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:29,260
谁知他很高尚地让给我
until he nobly stepped aside.

505
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,900
幸运的是 沙袋掉了 大家都怪他
Luckily, the sandbag fell, everyone blamed him,

506
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:32,920
我知道机会来了
and I just saw my opening.

507
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,380
是我把喷漆罐放在地上
I put the paint cans on the floor

508
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:37,040
又假装被那杯茶烫到
and pretended that the tea scalded me.

509
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:40,060
但看到他在台上玉石俱焚的样子
But to see him crash and burn on stage, that...

510
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,040
真是没什么比这更精彩了
It doesn't get better than that.

511
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:44,820
很快就有了
Oh, it's about to,

512
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,640
因为我把你的麦克打开了
because I turned your microphone on,

513
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:48,300
外面所有人都听见了
and everybody there is listening

514
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:49,737
你刚刚说的每句话
to everything that you just said!

515
00:17:49,737 --> 00:17:52,120
不是吧 不不不不
No. No! No, no, no, no, no, no.

516
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:52,980
你这个禽兽
You monster!

517
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,840
太精彩了 还没有广告
Amazing! And with no commercials!

518
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:00,520
身处森林最坏的事
The worst thing about the woods

519
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:02,824
就是你永远不知道会遇到什么
is you never know what you're gonna run into --

520
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,320
一只熊 一个不喜欢城里人的猎人
a bear, a hunter who doesn't take kindly to city folk,

521
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,300
更糟的是...
or worse...

522
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:09,488
我等不及了 我超爱吃烤棉花糖
I can't wait. I love S'mores.

523
00:18:09,488 --> 00:18:12,600
看到你的女儿比任何时候都开心
...your daughter, as happy as you've ever seen her.

524
00:18:12,600 --> 00:18:14,560
唯一能做的事就是偷偷溜回车里
The only thing to do was to sneak back to the car

525
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,580
想想该编什么谎话骗我爸
and think of a lie to tell my dad along the way.

526
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,160
那是什么
What was that?

527
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,400
我也不知道 我们赶快用铲子拍死它
I don't know, but let's hit it with a shovel.

528
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,640
再用棉花糖棒捅死它
And stab it with our marshmallow sticks!

529
00:18:23,402 --> 00:18:25,760
别别别 我是莉莉的爸爸
No! No, no, no, no! I-I'm Lily's dad.

530
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:26,920
我是莉莉的...她是我女儿
I'm Lily-- hi. She's mine.

531
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:28,637
你到这儿来干什么
what are you doing here?

532
00:18:28,637 --> 00:18:30,620
我以为你给我发了求救信号
Okay, I-I thought you gave me the signal.

533
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:31,649
没有 走开啦
No! Go away.

534
00:18:31,649 --> 00:18:33,540
你让我在一群8岁小孩面前丢脸了
You're embarrassing me in front of 8-year-olds.

535
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:33,900
抱歉
Sorry.

536
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:36,140
我刚给这些孩子们讲了个鬼故事
I just finished telling the girls a ghost story.

537
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:37,640
吓死人了
It was so scary.

538
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:38,640
你知道什么鬼故事吗
Do you know any?

539
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,720
我知道一个 是我当年露营时听到的
I do know one from my own camp days,

540
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,400
但对你们而言可能太过吓人了
but it's probably too scary for you, s--

541
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:44,280
-快跟我们说说 -好吧 好吧
- Tell us now! - Okay, okay.

542
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,760
真的很吓人 可别说我没警告过你们
It's really scary. Don't say I didn't warn you.

543
00:18:47,540 --> 00:18:48,860
这故事最好真的精彩
This better be good.

544
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:54,720
故事也发生在一个营地里 跟这里很像
I-it takes place at a camp a lot like this one,

545
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:57,680
在森林那边 有一个黑湖
Where just beyond the woods, there was a black lake.

546
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:00,540
在湖那边 有一个监狱
And just beyond the lake, there was a prison.

547
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:02,040
一点都不吓人啊
This isn't scary.

548
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:04,340
好吧 那是个闹鬼的...
Okay, it was a haunted pr--

549
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:06,220
那是个闹鬼的监狱
It was a haunted prison.

550
00:19:06,300 --> 00:19:09,580
有一天晚上 也就是满月之夜
Now, on this one night, the night of the full moon,

551
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:12,300
他们称之为"血月"
What they call "The blood moon"...

552
00:19:14,476 --> 00:19:17,160
那个监狱里 有一个鬼
Okay, what was at this prison was a -- was a ghost --

553
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:21,260
是个老人死后变成的鬼 眼睛闪着红光
The ghost of an old man with glowing red eyes,

554
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:22,600
可以喷火
Who breathed fire!

555
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:25,300
好无聊 我们能提前回去睡觉了吗
I'm bored. Can we go to sleep early?

556
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:27,800
我觉得你忘了今天是血月之夜吧
I think you're forgetting about the blood moon.

557
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,720
那是什么
What's that?!

558
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:31,240
闪着红光的眼睛
Glowing eyes!

559
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,180
是鬼啊
It's the ghost!

560
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,660
鬼来啦 不要啊
It's the ghost! No!

561
00:19:34,540 --> 00:19:34,940
姑娘们
Girls!

562
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,800
谢你了啊 现在她们应该会好好睡觉了
Thanks for that. Bedtime should be a treat.

563
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:43,640
看来你终于来营地救了我一次啊
Well, I guess you finally rescued me at camp.

564
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:44,660
就算迟了 有也胜过无
Better late than never.

565
00:19:46,601 --> 00:19:47,400
顺便说下 我当年的确
By the way, I should've

566
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,740
该去营地把你接回家的
come by and picked you up from camp.

567
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:51,240
要小孩独立自强那一套
That, uh, "Tough it out" stuff --

568
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,380
都是从我爸那里学来的
That was my dad talking.

569
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:54,960
他曾经把我丢进一个我很害怕的湖里
He threw me in a lake once I was afraid of.

570
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:55,700
我跟你说过那事吗
Did I ever tell you about that story?

571
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:57,040
是的 我们都听过那个故事
Yeah, yeah, we've all heard that story.

572
00:19:57,965 --> 00:19:59,080
你也别太自责了
Now, don't feel too bad.

573
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:01,020
我完全会错了莉莉的意思
I was completely wrong about Lily.

574
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:02,800
我差点让她没有享受到
I almost rescued her from

575
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:03,839
她这辈子最快乐的时光
having the time of her life.

576
00:20:03,839 --> 00:20:05,537
有时候事情就是这样的
Oh, that's the way of things.

577
00:20:05,577 --> 00:20:06,600
一切都自有结果 有一天
Things work out, and someday,

578
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,520
你也会看到她
you'll be able to see her

579
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:09,240
对她自己的孩子 也产生完全错误的理解
be completely wrong about her kids.

580
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:09,917
其实挺好玩的
It's fun.

581
00:20:09,917 --> 00:20:11,065
好吧
Oh. Okay.

582
00:20:11,334 --> 00:20:12,298
你想抽根雪茄吗
Want a cigar?

583
00:20:12,448 --> 00:20:14,136
不了 谢谢
No. No, thank you.

584
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:17,200
我小时候曾偷过一根雪茄抽
You know, I -- I once stole one of those when I was a kid.

585
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:18,580
抽的我晕乎乎的
Made me completely dizzy.

586
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:19,698
我都不记得当晚后来发生的事了
I don't remember the rest of the night.

587
00:20:19,698 --> 00:20:22,480
你接下来不是要去观看教职员才艺秀吗
Aren't you going to that faculty follies after this?

588
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,580
没错 那快给我一根
Yeah. Give me one of those.

589
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,280
我以为这里有一层台阶呢
I thought there was a step there.

590
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:31,440
等你把绷带拆除了
Oh, yeah, you'll get your depth perception back

591
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,600
深度知觉就会回来了
once you get the bandages off.

592
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:33,520
楼梯中间当心点
Careful in the middle, there.

593
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:34,540
我还没来得及修...
I still haven't a chance to --

594
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:35,000
我知道的
I know.

595
00:20:36,260 --> 00:20:37,880
我以为是艾丽克斯回来了呢
I thought you were Alex.

596
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,260
她没有被录取
She didn't get in.

597
00:20:39,340 --> 00:20:40,380
不要啊
Oh, no!

598
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:41,680
愚蠢的哈佛大学
Stupid Harvard.

599
00:20:41,900 --> 00:20:42,660
愚蠢的哈佛大学
"Stupid Harvard"?

600
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:44,060
她也没被普林斯顿大学录取吗
She didn't get into Princeton, either?

601
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:45,060
不是啦 只被哈佛拒了
No, just Harvard.

602
00:20:45,560 --> 00:20:47,260
我觉得这个有助于缓解那事对她的打击
I thought that this might soften the blow.

603
00:20:47,260 --> 00:20:48,620
我还做了她最爱吃的菜
And I made her her favorite dinner.

604
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:49,980
你真是个好妈妈
You're such a good mom.

605
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:52,100
她回来啦
There she is!

606
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:54,200
嗨 我都听说了
Hi. I heard.

607
00:20:54,380 --> 00:20:55,300
我真的很遗憾
I'm so sorry.

608
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:57,180
谢了 妈
Uh, thanks, mom,

609
00:20:57,260 --> 00:20:59,480
但海莉已经让我心里舒坦多了
but Haley already made me feel a little better about it.

610
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:01,860
我现在不想说话
I just don't really feel like talking right now.

611
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:04,600
我只想去修改下密码 然后就睡觉
I kind of just want to change my password and get into bed.

612
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:05,300
好吧
Okay.

613
00:21:06,180 --> 00:21:08,420
她只是需要点时间去淡然接受这事
She just needs a little bit of time to work through it.

614
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:10,040
独自吗
Alone?

615
00:21:10,949 --> 00:21:12,445
孩子们都长大了
The kids are growing up.

616
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:15,298
看来他们已经不那么需要我们了
Guess they don't need us as much anymore.

617
00:21:15,298 --> 00:21:17,181
原本就该是这样才对啊
Oh, well, that was the plan.

618
00:21:17,300 --> 00:21:17,620
我只是当初以为
I just thought

619
00:21:17,620 --> 00:21:18,780
我们不会这么失落难受
it would feel better than this.

620
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:19,800
我也是
Me too.

621
00:21:21,300 --> 00:21:22,660
至少我们还需要彼此
At least we still need each other.

622
00:21:22,696 --> 00:21:24,310
我真的好幸运
And I get so lucky.

623
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:24,920
行了
Ok.

624
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:26,660
泡妞绝技宝刀未老
Still got it!
